//
// Admin-specific hardcoded values (used inline or with []):
//   bg-[#0D1117]   — admin sidebar/page bg
//   bg-[#F59E0B]   — amber-500 active state
//   text-amber-400 — active nav text
//   border-slate-700 — admin card border
